    <string name="HelpText1">1. Click the packs button to show the packs you\'ve created or have access to\n2. Click the edit button to delete a card in the current pack\n3. Click the plus symbol to create a new pack</string>
    <string name="HelpText2">1. Click the paint brush to change the colour palette of your cards\n2. Click the information symbol to get to this screen\n3. Click the settings button to access the settings of the app</string>
    <string name="HelpText2_iPhone">1. Click the paint brush to change the colour palette of your cards\n2. Click the play button to play the card!</string>
    <string name="HelpText3">1. Click the share button to upload your pack to drop box and share with others\n2. Click the play button to play the card!</string>
    <string name="HelpText3_iPhone">1. Click the information symbol to get to this screen\n2. Click the settings button to access the settings of the app\n3. Click the share button to upload your pack to drop box and share with others\n4. Click the play button to play the card!</string>
    <string name="HelpText4">Click the plus symbol to add a new card to your current pack</string>
    <string name="HelpText5">Other buttons:\n1. You can click on the template button to change the template\n2.You can click on it and choose an image as the card\'s background from your image library\n3. You can record a sound here</string>
    <string name="HelpText6">1. Click the card you want to edit\n2. Click anywhere in the card to edit the text, or click on an image to choose a new image,video, or even insert a youtube linkage</string>
    <string name="HelpText6_iPhone">1. Click on an image to choose a new image,video, or even insert a youtube linkage\n2. Click anywhere in the card to edit the text</string>
    <string name="HelpText7">When you are editing you can change the alignment, size, colour, font and symbol of the text by clicking these buttons</string>
    <string name="Copyright">Flip Card Creator has been developed by Flip Flash Cards Pty Ltd in conjunction with development team Internetics Pty Ltd.\n\nCopyright Flip Flash Cards 2015. All rights reserved.\n\nFor information on how to use the application, please click the (i) information button above.\n\nPlease submit any technical feedback to fcc@internetics.net.au\n\nThank you for your interest in the Flash Card Creator app and Flip Flash Cards Pty Ltd.</string>
    <string name="Record_Introduction_Text">When you click “Record” you have a maximum of 30 seconds to record your message. \n\nClick “Stop” when ready to stop recording.\n\nYou can then click “Play” to hear it, or “Save” to save it to the card.</string>
    <string name="Record_Introduction_Text2">Record is finished, you can playback or save the recorded sound</string>
